 for an alternative to the CL21A106KAYNNNE, you should search for a multilayer ceramic capacitor (MLCC) with an 0805 package size, a 10uF capacitance, a voltage rating of at least 25V, and an X5R (or better) temperature coefficient."},{"question":"Is the CL21A106KAYNNNE Capacitor Compatible With Automated SMT Assembly Lines?","answer":"Yes, it is fully compatible. The component is packaged in a standard 0805 surface-mount device (SMD) format and is available in Cut Tape or LCSC-Reel configurations, making it ideal for standard automated pick-and-place assembly machinery."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C15850","authenticationList":["ROHS 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1864931","fileName":" 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1750838","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1478399","fileName":"MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"}],"productDescEn":"10uF ±10% 25V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0805","productIntroEn":"10uF ±10% 25V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0805","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10951_n","paramName":"容值","paramNameEn":"Capacitance","paramValue":"10uF","paramValueEn":"10uF","paramValueEnForSearch":1.0E7,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_10927","paramName":"温度系数","paramNameEn":"Temperature Coefficient","paramValue":"X5R","paramValueEn":"X5R","paramValueEnForSearch":-1.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":4},{"paramCode":"param_10923_s","paramName":"精度","paramNameEn":"Tolerance","paramValue":"±10%","paramValueEn":"±10%","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":2},{"paramCode":"param_10924_n","paramN